cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EBIV Studio: C++ interface for event-based imaging velocimetry"
message: >-
  EBIV Studio re-implements the EBIV processing of C. Willert (DLR). If you publish results obtained with it,
  please cite the EBIV software and publications listed under "references".
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tristan
    family-names: Montagnier
repository-code: "https://github.com/RexAttaque/EBIVStudio"
